with Zoe Saldana, we would --

00:02:03.067 --> 00:02:04.300
I did a song.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.334
I did "Baby Got Back" for her.

00:02:06.334 --> 00:02:08.167
[ Laughter ]
As Gollum.

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:10.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.267 --> 00:02:12.968
♪♪

00:02:12.968 --> 00:02:17.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:17.968 --> 00:02:22.067
