-Yes, for the rest of the show.

00:03:05.133 --> 00:03:06.300
[ Normal voice ]
No, I'm -- I'm back.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.667
-Oh, my gosh.
-I'm back, I'm back.

00:03:08.667 --> 00:03:12.234
-I also heard --
I also heard that before the --

00:03:12.234 --> 00:03:15.634
