00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:51.868
-Yeah, it's a difficult thing.

00:04:51.868 --> 00:04:53.801
But we had
a beautiful community.

00:04:53.801 --> 00:04:57.734
Everything about this movie
was -- was rooted in love.

00:04:57.734 --> 00:05:00.167
Chinonye, our director,
all of our producers, they --

00:05:00.167 --> 00:05:02.400
