taking good care of each other.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:06.634
-Yeah, it's -- it almost
was never made, this movie.

00:05:06.634 --> 00:05:10.033
-Yeah, it's taken --
Well, truthfully, 67 years,

00:05:10.033 --> 00:05:14.400
