00:05:19.033 --> 00:05:22.300
But then Barbara Broccoli,
Whoopi, all of them,

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:25.734
and Keith Beauchamp,
who was her mentee,

00:05:25.734 --> 00:05:29.200
